# S-17 — Outbox, notifications and documents (#88, OutboxDispatcher). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# start-up drained the 18 rows queued since S-15 (OrderPlaced ×6, OrderPaid ×3, RenderDocuments ×3, FinanceAlert ×3,
#   DedicationCard, OrderCancelled, OrderExpired): all processed at attempt 1; order_paid SMS + e-mail once per recipient,
#   staff_alert e-mails to store-alerts@ta3lom.sa, DR-2026-000001…3 rendered to private documents/2026/*.pdf
# new paid order T3-26-001008 (dedicated cooler + zakat) → DR-2026-000004.pdf (Arabic shaping, real donor name, zakat line,
#   dedication name, no English/bidi mix-ups) within ~1 s of the dev trigger
# retry: API started with Store__Sms__Provider=unifonic (no keys) → attempt 1: e-mail sent, SMS failed ("sms provider not
#   configured"), message rescheduled; restarted with the sink → attempt 2: SMS sent, e-mail NOT re-sent
#   (ux_notification_once: 1 sms row + 1 email row, both sent)
# #88 resend (admin): 202 → e-mail with DR-2026-000004.pdf attached + SMS; unpaid order → 409 document.not_ready;
#   channels ["fax"] → 400 validation.failed; viewer → 403
# integrity checks: 0 rows
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1
@dev = http://localhost:5080/dev
@admin = <admin access token>

### E-mail sink (newest first)
GET {{dev}}/mail?count=5

### SMS sink
GET {{dev}}/sms?count=5

### #88 Resend documents
POST {{base}}/admin/orders/T3-26-001008/resend-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"channels":["email","sms"]}

### #88 Not ready (unpaid order) → 409 document.not_ready
POST {{base}}/admin/orders/T3-26-001000/resend-documents
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"channels":["sms"]}
